    "reviews": "\u201c...a great strategy game, a great party-based permadeath RPG. It's got really interesting tactical elements and a unique gameplay style.\u201d<br>Table 53<br><br>\u201cThe Dungeon Beneath offers players an inviting opportunity to explore a dungeon, slay a variety of monsters from skeletons to floating eyes, outsmart their leaders, defeat a couple of gods, and then do it all over again.\u201d<br>In Pursuit of Loot<br><br>\u201cThe Dungeon Beneath is a very simple, but compelling, turn-based auto-battler; small unit count, each with special abilities, must be placed in the most advantageous positions each turn to win\u201d<br>Designer Plays<br>",
